      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "EVIL EYE (7) wound up strongly to place two back then did the same last time, finishing on late when second (16.67) in a Free For All at this track. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. One of the leading chances. ELECTROJET (5) is a fast dog well performed over the sprint races. Finished third latest over 450m at Ballarat (25.40) in a Grade 4/5 but is better suited here over less ground. Form at the trip strong including one wins. Will give a great sight again. CONTRADICTION (3) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at Geelong behind Baby Beets (25.94) in a Grade 4/5. Settled off speed and worked to the line nicely. Leading player again. UPENDED (1) is in form and worth thought again.",
